    "description": "Bendos Action Figure Lot - 5 Figures and Accessories\nKid Galaxy, Vintage 1999-2000\n3 Sealed In Tubes, 2 Loose\nThis collection features five bendable figures from Kid Galaxy's popular Bendos line, which dominated the poseable toy market in the late 1990s and early 2000s. Known for their distinct minimalist face designs and wire-core flexibility, Bendos are sought after for their unique aesthetic. This lot includes three factory-sealed figures in original cylindrical packaging and two loose figures with character-specific accessories.\nFigures Included:\nMega-Parachute Bendo - Sealed in large tube #604, includes red parachute.\nSanta Bendo - Sealed in tube #270, includes green toy sack accessory.\nDiamond Softball Player - Sealed in tube #103, includes baseball bat.\nScuba Diver and Tech Figure - Loose figures with \"Kid Galaxy\" markings.\nAccessories: Diving helmet, daisy acoustic guitar, two money bags, and snowboard.\nCondition:\nThree figures are factory sealed in original plastic tubes; tubes show light shelf wear and minor scuffing. Loose figures show minor paint rubs consistent with light use but retain full poseability. All included accessories are in good vintage condition with vibrant colors and no structural damage.\nPayment Extensions -\nDue to demand, we will no longer extend any payment deadlines.\nAuthenticated Items Returns & Refund Disclaimer -\nRefunds and returns must be inquired on within 7 days of receipt of item(s). Returns on authenticated items will be refunded the amount paid for the item (excluding shipping and handling) less a restocking fee.\nCustomer Service -\nCustomer messages are processed Monday through Friday between 7:00am to 3:00 pm EST. We strive to respond to all customer messages within 48 hours.  Inquiries about auctions ending in less than 24 hours may not be answered before the end of the auction.",
